      "classification": "Mixed upstream data notices; do not label the complete dictionary SPDX-only. README.txt identifies mecab-ipadic-2.7.0-20070801 as the base vocabulary and states a large portion originates from ICOT Free Software. It reproduces NAIST permission and disclaimer, ICOT no-warranty conditions, and an Okinawa Dictionary public-domain notice. Preserve both Mozc LICENSE and dictionary README notice with any redistributed dictionary data.",
      "scope_caveat": "Mozc README says its open-source dictionary excludes the large Web-corpus vocabulary set and Japanese postal-code dictionary. It describes vocabulary as basically the IPAdic vocabulary plus Okinawa named entities, manually added entries and Katakana/compound additions; this is not Google's production Google Japanese Input dictionary."
